    turnFlow: 'Each turn: draw one piece (from discard or from table in distribution order), then discard one. Starting player may declare immediately if holding three sets; otherwise discards. First player to hold three valid sets after drawing declares and wins. If the table is exhausted with no declaration, there is no winner.',
