      'Turn-flow example: Each turn: draw one piece (from discard or from table in distribution order), then discard one. Starting player may declare immediately if holding three sets; otherwise discards. First player to hold three valid sets after drawing declares and wins. If the table is exhausted with no declaration, there is no winner.',
      'Scoring example: No point scoring; first player to hold three valid sets of two and declare wins. If table is exhausted with no declaration, there is no winner. First player to hold six pieces forming three valid sets of two (Gou or Doi) and declare wins..',
